0008's `TOOLCHAIN_WIRE_SHAPES` table and `EXACT_PROPERTY_SCHEMAS` had already
been holding those three names to while they were reservations. Minting them
therefore required no relaxation of that guard: it went from checking three
absent definitions to checking three present ones.

The four receipt, marker and claim slots decision 0008 reserved stay
unallocated. Nothing in the toolchain contract re-versions them, and decision
