### Gates

- **Wire surface** (`tools/toolchain_gate.py`, run by both `validate.py` and
  `release_gate.py`): enumerates every property name of every published
  build-command and descriptor-target definition, including inside the
  requirement object and its three version kinds, and fails on a name that would
