- **Guidance catalog**: the section 6.1 identity mapping, identifier grammar,
  one-active-per-tuple, supersession well-formedness, one origin per
  (class, reason), and section 6.3 coverage and reachability against the
  registry.
- **Diagnostics**: every payload lands on a declared firing site keyed on
  `(code, stage, discriminant)`, every declared site carries an instance, every
  `guidance_id` resolves to an active revisioned entry whose reason is the code's
  own suffix, and no payload carries prose or a URL.
